an</u></strong> \u2013 luxury under the palm trees. The residence of an Egyptian official is full of decorations, rooms, and also with a garden and a swimming pool. Ventilation, a water tank and the coolness of the walls allow you to survive the heat, and the building itself contrasts with the simple peasant's houses in Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967780/extras/80588139d42f50176a297aaa35c9b1ed.avif?t=1757362021\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26ea <strong><u>Egyptian temple \u2013 home of the gods</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A monumental stone structure, decorated with columns, pylons, and hieroglyphs. Dedicated to the gods, it exudes an aura of mysticism. Its orientation and construction teach astronomy, spirituality, and the power of Egyptian engineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967780/extras/77df59a5da96d821de3437eeb7406f50.avif?t=1757362021\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["FreeMind S.A."],"fullgame":{"appid":"1244630","name":"House Builder"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967780/30e775b51cde0d5506d1788b4907fbb54f04f9f9/header.jpg?t=1757362021","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192100,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192100/movie480.mp4?t=1756809566","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192100/movie_max.mp4?t=1756809566"}